# ADR-039 — source imagery is fetched, verified and cached, never committed.
# The verified-source cache (tools/fetch_textures.py; override with
# SOLAR_VOYAGER_TEXTURE_CACHE) and every fetched file under the authoring
# workspace. SOURCES.md stays committed: attribution is the repo's obligation,
# the pixels are not. Sources committed before ADR-039 are already tracked and
# are unaffected by these patterns — no history is rewritten.
.texture-cache/
assets/textures-src/**
!assets/textures-src/**/
!assets/textures-src/**/SOURCES.md
!assets/textures-src/.gitkeep
